        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-22T21:55:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Rabit&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Rabit\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The Conscience\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n The Conscience:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also (guilty secret here) make custom dice bags.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What kind of dice bags?  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The kind one puts dice in. Seriously they are geared towards gamers (especially ones that have LOTS of dice, you know who you are.)</p>",
