      {
        "id": 31082,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T00:00:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>[quote=““The Conscience””]</p>\n<p>The kind one puts dice in. Seriously they are geared towards gamers (especially ones that have LOTS of dice, you know who you are.)</p>\n<p>[/quote]</p>\n<p>Sorry - I should have been more specific. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>What are they made of? Cloth, chain, leather, bubbles?</p>\n<p>And yes, I <span class=\"bbcode-b\">do</span> know how I am. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>(I’m looking for a new bag at Origins and GenCon, as my ~30-year-old Crown Royal bag finally started developing holes, so…)</p>",
