      {
        "id": 31083,
        "name": "Tamar",
        "username": "Tamar",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T01:39:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>[quote=““The Conscience””]</p>\n<p>I also (guilty secret here) make custom dice bags.</p>\n<p>[/quote]</p>\n<p>Fun!  I’ve sewn a couple for friends and stuff, but I’ve never done them for sale or anything.  Our local game store back in Kansas city sold them from a local maker and I didn’t want to step on any toes by putting my stuff in there too.  Maybe I’ll check into that when I find out my preferred local game store.<br>\nAnd for all that I could make myself a cool bag, I’m using a chainmail one made by the hubby <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;arenson9&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"arenson9\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I volunteer a bit at an organization that rescues food: <a href=\"http://www.secondhelpings.org/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.secondhelpings.org/</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I immediately new what this meant, but it didn’t stop my brain from feeding me a picture of sad little sandwiches and bowls of pasta and stuff in animal shelter type cages.  <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#MyBrainIsWeird</span></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Rabit&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Rabit\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sorry - I should have been more specific. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>What are they made of? Cloth, chain, leather, bubbles?</p>\n<p>(I’m looking for a new bag at Origins and GenCon, as my ~30-year-old Crown Royal bag finally started developing holes, so…)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ooh, bubbles!  I want a bubbles dice bag!</p>",
