        "created_at": "2012-05-23T02:16:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Tamar&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Tamar\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ooh, bubbles!  I want a bubbles dice bag!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I know, right?! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
