      {
        "id": 31086,
        "name": "Gnipp",
        "username": "Gnipp",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/65b543/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T05:37:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, hobbies other than gaming…</p>\n<p>I am always trying to find time to do more gaming.  Does that count?</p>\n<p>Between work and familytime(my 6 year old daughter plays SOTM with me sometimes -she likes Wraith) my actual gaming time is small.  So I’m constantly thinking of game stuff and reading rules(yes, I know I’m a geek).  I host a once a year weekend long invite only game convention at my house called SloCon that just recently ended so now I get to look forward to GenCon.</p>\n<p>And color me interested in the dice bag discussion as well.</p>",
