        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T11:33:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I make the dice bags out of 100% cotton fabric that I find in fabric stores when the better half goes shopping for quilting stuff. I can post some pics later when I swing by the local shop where I have them for sale. Also I can do whatever fabric you would like as long as you provide the fabric in the pattern you desire.</p>",
