      {
        "id": 31088,
        "name": "beevolant",
        "username": "beevolant",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-23T20:30:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Like TamarBatAvraham, I am also in the SCA (<a href=\"http://www.sca.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.sca.org</a>) and I do a lot of administrative type stuff with that organization (I’m the recruitment and retention officer for the multi-state region and maintain the membership database). Being in the SCA leads to a lot of camping, crafting, and doing random awesome things like writing poems in medieval German.</p>\n<p>I also do some sewing, mostly medieval clothing for the SCA, though I am making an awesome quilted mobile of the solar system for the parasite I’m rocking right now. I recently took up metal working - jewelry stuff, some bronze casting, pierce work, that sort of thing. I also brew beer, mead, and other random stuff that sounds delicious.</p>\n<p>I’m currently playing in a pathfinder game too. Most of my time right now though has been going to the SCA and getting my life ready for a baby.</p>",
