        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/eb9ed0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-24T04:16:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am an Avid reader, keep trying to write stuff, doesn’t usually work out.  I do write poetry, however ( you can find some <a href=\"http://allpoetry.com/master_dragon\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>.  Otherwise, I’m an avid gamer willing to try any game once.   Used to do SCA thinking about getting back into it.</p>",
